      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S ROCKY (2) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 14 from 19 starts. Filled a minor placings again last time when third (20.10) at this track making it three placings in a row. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Deserves serious consideration. SKETCHY DYNAMIC (4) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 3 lengths away in second (19.94) at this track in a Grade 5 over 340m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Racing well and deserves a win. GENUINE ARTICLE (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 340m behind From The Disco (20.42) in a Grade 5. Has ability and can measure up. MCVEE (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
